  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Global Procurement Initiative: Procurement Assistance Program for Ethiopia: Phases III, through Crown Agents Ltd.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical assistance grant provides funding for a Procurement Advisor to assist the Ethiopian Electric Power (EEP) for a period of 18 months. The grant represents Phase III of the Procurement Assistance Program for Ethiopia under the Global Procurement Initiative. The Advisor will provide strategic and technical procurement advice on energy sector procurements, with the goal of incorporating value-based methodologies into EEP&apos;s procurement process. A value-based procurement system will help EEP implement sustainable, high-quality energy projects and may increase opportunities for U.S. companies to bid on and potentially win energy tenders.</narrative>
  </description>
